# M5-T096 CAD owner-sample files: EXACT bytes. Each file's sha256 is pinned in
# README.md and regenerated byte-identically by
# services/api/tests/cad/test_cad_owner_samples.py. The repo has core.autocrlf=true,
# so mark these binary: the DXF is ASCII-with-LF (a CRLF smudge would change every
# line), the PDF carries CR/LF in its xref (normalization would corrupt it), and
# the GLB is binary. No line-ending conversion, no diff, no merge.
*.dxf binary
*.pdf binary
*.glb binary
